OL,3,GNEWSASummer holiday season 'almost 10
OL,4,Aout of 10'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA holiday park owner has said the
OL,7,Fweather this summer helped boost
OL,8,Fbookings in a season that had been
OL,9,F"almost 10 out of 10".
OL,11,FJon Hyatt, of Hendra Holiday Park in
OL,12,FNewquay said 2026, had been 'building
OL,13,Ffrom January", after quieter years for
OL,14,Fthe industry in 2024 and 2025.
OL,16,FSally Everton, of tourism organisation
OL,17,FVisit Devon, said this year had been a
OL,18,F"mixed bag" but coastal holiday
OL,19,Flocations had benefitted from the
OL,20,Fsunshine.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
