OL,3,GNEWSASummer holiday season 'almost 10
OL,4,Aout of 10'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Devon Association of Tourist
OL,7,FAttractions said its members had given
OL,8,F"mixed reviews" of the year, with some
OL,9,Freporting lower visitor numbers as
OL,10,Fholidaymakers opted for "beach days
OL,11,Fover attraction days".
